### LOGIN AS ADMIN
POST {{Task_Management_System_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### LOGIN AS MANAGER
POST {{Task_Management_System_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "manager",
  "password": "manager123"
}

### LOGIN AS EMPLOYEE
POST {{Task_Management_System_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "employee",
  "password": "employee123"
}

### LOGIN WITHOUT API KEY - SHOULD FAIL
POST {{Task_Management_System_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### LOGIN WITH WRONG API KEY - SHOULD FAIL
POST {{Task_Management_System_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: wrong-key

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### LOGIN WITH BACKUP API KEY - SHOULD WORK
